@Host = http://localhost:5000

### GET products with API Key
GET {{Host}}/api/product
X-Api-Key: SecretKey123

### GET products without API Key (expect 401)
GET {{Host}}/api/product

### Login
POST {{Host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "student", "password": "12345" }

### Protected products (replace token)
GET {{Host}}/api/product/secure
X-Api-Key: SecretKey123
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
